l\">ou</span> <span class=\"ital\">le</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">fut.</span> <span class=\"aut\">Thc.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">6, 60,</span> s’indigner que ; <span class=\"grec\">δεινὰ ποιεῖν,</span> <span class=\"ital\">m. sign.</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"refch\">3, 14 ;</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Thc.</span> <span class=\"refch\">5, 42 ;</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">qqf. en ce sens</span> <span class=\"grec\">δεινὰ\nπάσχειν,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Dém.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1233, 25 ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">de même,</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">τὸν δὲ δεινόν τι ἔσχε αὐτόν,</span> <span class=\"ital\">avec l’inf.</span> <span class=\"aut\">Hdt.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">1, 61,</span> il fut saisi d’indignation que,\n<span class=\"ital\">etc.</span> (<span class=\"ital\">v. n<span class=\"up\">o</span> suiv.</span> <span class=\"grec\">δεινὰ\nποιεῖσθαι</span>) ||</div>\n<div class=\"rub\"><span class=\"ruba\">V</span> qui frappe\nl’imagination, étonnant, extraordinaire, <span class=\"ital\">d’où :</span>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> fort, puissant,\n<span class=\"ital\">en parl. de divinités</span> (Athènè,\n<span class=\"aut\">Il.</span> <span class=\"refch\">6, 380 ;</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Od.</span> <span class=\"refch\">7, 41 ;</span>\nCalypso, <span class=\"aut\">Od.</span> <span class=\"refch\">12,\n449</span>) ; <span class=\"ital\">de personnes, joint à</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">ἀτάσθαλος,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Hdt.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">7, 116 ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">de\nchoses</span> (bouclier, <span class=\"aut\">Il.</span> <span class=\"refch\">7, 245 ;</span> désir violent, <span class=\"aut\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"refch\">9, 3 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Rsp.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">573</span><span class=\"refpb\">d</span> ; amour,\n<span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Theæt.</span>\n<span cla